        "sampleFormat": "s16le",
        "sampleRate": 48000
      },
      "sampleFrameCount": 238080,
      "ttsText": "卫星高速运动，让它的钟按照狭义相对论每天慢大约七微秒。"
    },
    {
      "checksum": "sha256:7abf2949ca9affce1c25775fa878ab61363d09aa3f340f0dfca79c64ca748f5b",
